{
 "@context": "http://schema.org/",
 "@type": "JobPosting",
 "title": "Tax Accountant",
 "description": "<div style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">\n<p style=\"color: #2d2d2d; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Hi there! We are South and our client is looking for a Senior Tax Accountant<strong>!</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold); font-weight: 600;\">Note to Applicants:</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"color: rgb(13, 13, 13); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold); font-weight: 600;\">Eligibility:</strong> This position is open to candidates residing in Latin America.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold); font-weight: 600;\">Application Language:</strong> Please submit your CV in English. Applications submitted in other languages will not be considered.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-bold); font-weight: 600;\">Professional Presentation:</strong> We encourage you to showcase your professional experience by including a Loom video in the application form. While this is optional, candidates who provide a video presentation will be given priority.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<p><strong>Interview Policy:</strong> The use of artificial intelligence (AI) tools during interviews are strictly prohibited.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"365\">Note:</strong> As part of the final stages of the selection process, contractors may be asked to provide professional references for a reference check. If you're selected, you may also be asked to update their LinkedIn profile. 🙂</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">About the Role</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"> We're looking for an experienced tax professional to lead tax planning and preparation for a diverse book of business and individual clients. This is a senior role with a path to reviewing and mentoring junior staff, so we want someone who can own complex work independently and, over time, help raise the bar across the team.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">Key Responsibilities</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Prepare and manage complex federal and state tax returns for businesses (C-corp, S-corp, partnership) and individuals</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Provide proactive tax planning and advisory for both business and individual clients, identifying savings opportunities and managing exposure</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Prepare returns using CCH (Axcess Tax / ProSystem fx/</span><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);\">BNA Tax Planner</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">)</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Research and resolve complex tax issues and respond to notices</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Review returns and work prepared by lower-level staff once ramped up, providing feedback and guidance</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Communicate directly with clients on tax matters, deadlines, and planning strategies</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px;\">Identify tax strategies and opportunities for clients and model scenarios that simulate implementation of each comparatively.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">Qualifications</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 11pt;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">5+ years of tax experience in a public accounting firm</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Strong hands-on experience with complex business and individual returns</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Proficiency with CCH (Axcess or ProSystem fx)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">CPA or EA&nbsp;</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Solid understanding of federal and multi-state tax</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">Strong review, organizational, and client-communication skills</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px;\">Fluency in English C1- reading, writing, and speaking.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--font-size-small); font-weight: var(--artdeco-reset-typography-font-weight-normal); line-height: var(--artdeco-reset-typography_getLineHeight);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;If this opportunity sounds good to you, <strong style=\"font-weight: var(--artdeco-reset-typography-font-weight-bold);\">send us your resume!</strong><br></span></p>\n</div>",
